    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "The main character is a man in love with nature, and he has a camera to photograph beautiful places and animals. The player can choose the angle and photograph various objects - flowers, trees, birds, animals and other animals that can be found in the Russian nature. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.poster.avif?t=1709384263\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.webm?t=1709384263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.mp4?t=1709384263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Realistic graphics allows you to see every detail and creates an atmosphere of complete merging with nature. It depends on the player what moments he wants to capture on his photos. He can search for the most beautiful and unique landscapes, follow the behavior of animals to capture unique moments.<br><br>The game has no specific goals or objectives. It is simply designed to help the player to relax, unwind and enjoy the nature on the screen. The musical accompaniment adds to the atmosphere and helps to create an immersive gameplay experience.<br><br>Russian Soul Simulator is designed to show the beauty of Russian nature and its uniqueness. It can be an inspiration for those who want to take a break from the hustle and bustle of city life and satiate themselves with the beauty and tranquility of nature.",
    "about_the_game": "The main character is a man in love with nature, and he has a camera to photograph beautiful places and animals. The player can choose the angle and photograph various objects - flowers, trees, birds, animals and other animals that can be found in the Russian nature. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.poster.avif?t=1709384263\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.webm?t=1709384263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734520/extras/5fc12fc390e11aaa58a9e64a1404b0f3.mp4?t=1709384263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Realistic graphics allows you to see every detail and creates an atmosphere of complete merging with nature. It depends on the player what moments he wants to capture on his photos. He can search for the most beautiful and unique landscapes, follow the behavior of animals to capture unique moments.<br><br>The game has no specific goals or objectives. It is simply designed to help the player to relax, unwind and enjoy the nature on the screen. The musical accompaniment adds to the atmosphere and helps to create an immersive gameplay experience.<br><br>Russian Soul Simulator is designed to show the beauty of Russian nature and its uniqueness. It can be an inspiration for those who want to take a break from the hustle and bustle of city life and satiate themselves with the beauty and tranquility of nature.",
    "short_description": "Russian Soul Simulator is a meditative game that allows the player to look at the Russian nature and the surrounding world in realistic graphics. The game allows the hero to move freely through fields and forests, explore the surrounding terrain and interact with various objects.",
